### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8003/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@postId =
@mediaId =
@tagId =

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ==================== TAGS ====================

### Create Tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Technology",
  "slug": "technology"
}

### Get All Tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags

### Get Tag by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/{{tagId}}

### Delete Tag
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tags/{{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== MEDIA ====================

### Upload Media
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

url=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg
&type=image
&provider=cloudinary

### Get Media by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Media
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/media/{{mediaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== POSTS ====================

### Create Post (Draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-user-id: 09764c73-129b-4f05-8c45-8c2849014ede

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post",
  "slug": "my-first-blog-post",
  "excerpt": "This is a short excerpt of my blog post",
  "content": "This is the full content of my blog post. It can be very long.",
  "cover_media_id": null,
  "media_ids": [],
  "tag_ids": []
}

### Update Post
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Blog Post Title",
  "excerpt": "Updated excerpt",
  "content": "Updated content - this will create a new version",
  "cover_media_id": null,
  "media_ids": [],
  "tag_ids": []
}

### Get Post by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}

### Get Post by Slug (Published only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/slug/my-first-blog-post

### List All Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&per_page=10

### List Posts by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?status=draft&page=1&per_page=10

### List Posts by Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?author_id=USER_UUID&page=1&per_page=10

### List Posts by Tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?tag_id=TAG_UUID&page=1&per_page=10

### List Published Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?status=published&page=1&per_page=10

### Publish Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unpublish Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== COMPLETE WORKFLOW ====================

### 1. Create Tags
# @name createTag1
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Golang",
  "slug": "golang"
}

### 2. Create another Tag
# @name createTag2
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Microservices",
  "slug": "microservices"
}

### 3. Upload Cover Image
# @name uploadCover
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

url=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg
&type=image
&provider=cloudinary

### 4. Upload Content Image
# @name uploadImage
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

url=https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample2.jpg
&type=image
&provider=cloudinary

### 5. Create Post with Tags and Media
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Building Microservices with Golang",
  "slug": "building-microservices-with-golang",
  "excerpt": "Learn how to build scalable microservices using Golang",
  "content": "In this comprehensive guide, we'll explore how to build microservices with Golang...",
  "cover_media_id": "COVER_MEDIA_ID",
  "media_ids": ["IMAGE_MEDIA_ID"],
  "tag_ids": ["GOLANG_TAG_ID", "MICROSERVICES_TAG_ID"]
}

### 6. Update Post Content (Create new version)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Updated content with more details about microservices architecture..."
}

### 7. Publish the Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. View Published Post
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/slug/building-microservices-with-golang
